@startuml
title Change3 - cancellation refund Strategy
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class BookingsController {
  cancel()
}
class CancellationService {
  initialize(booking, policy:)
  call(at: Time.current)
}
class CancellationPolicy {
  cancellable?(booking, at:)
  refund_amount(booking, at:)
}
class FlexibleCancellationPolicy
class PartialRefundCancellationPolicy {
  initialize(rate: 0.5)
}
class NoRefundCancellationPolicy
class Booking {
  canceled_at
  cancellation_refund_amount
}
BookingsController ..> CancellationService : authorized client
CancellationService --> CancellationPolicy : injected policy
CancellationService --> Booking : locks and updates
CancellationPolicy <|-- FlexibleCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- PartialRefundCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- NoRefundCancellationPolicy
note bottom of CancellationService
  Delegates both rule methods.
  Stores calculated refund; no Stripe transfer.
  Source: checkpoints/Change3/app/services/
end note
@enduml
